Funding text 1: The authors would like to thank Prof. Dr. Mark BASKARAN, Dr. Jean Luc REGNIER, Assoc. Prof. Dr. Alexander BRANDL, Prof. Dr. Paul MANN, Assoc. Prof. Dr. Sena Ak\u00E7er \u00D6N, Dr. Zeki Bora \u00D6N, Prof. Dr. Ergun KARACAN, Prof. Dr. Murat G\u00DCL, Assoc. Prof. Dr. Mehmet Rifat KAHYALIO\u011ELU, Assist. Prof. Dr. Murat Ersen AKSOY, Prof. Dr. Tolga \u00C7AN, Dr. T\u00FCrkan ALKAN, Mr. Furkan NUR and Mr. Hasan KOSKA for the advice on technical studies. The authors would also like to extend our thanks to Prof. Dr. Semih G\u00DCRSU as well as some part of the field works that were financially supported by his special T\u00DCB\u0130TAK project (No:118Y418) from The Scientific and Technological Research Council of T\u00FCrkiye (T\u00DCB\u0130TAK) until July 09, 2020. The English language of the manuscript was edited by Dr. Iliya Bauchi DANLADI and Mr. Jacob DOYLE. The authors also thank the reviewers and the editor for their valuable comments, which have immensely helped in the correction of the manuscript.
