Correspondence Address: Y. Chen; School of Transportation Engineering, East China Jiaotong University, Nanchang, 330013, China; email: ygchan@mail.ustc.edu.cn; J. Li; The First Monitoring and Application Center, China Earthquake Administration, Tianjin, 300180, China; email: li-jingwei@cug.edu.cn},
